 "mode": "flow",
 "duration": 201.568,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "This is this week's Fortnite Item Shop! The biggest bundles, every new drop, and every OG that came back.",
   "t0": 0.2,
   "t1": 5.685
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven days of the shop, from November 3rd to November 9th, straight from Epic's own Item Shop data.",
   "t0": 5.965,
   "t1": 10.89
  },
  {
   "text": "Let's get into it!",
   "t0": 11.19,
   "t1": 11.85
  },
  {
   "text": "First, the biggest bundle of the week.",
   "t0": 12.25,
   "t1": 13.809
  },
  {
   "text": "The Adventure Time Bundle! Finn, Jake, Princess Bubblegum, Marceline, and more. 13 items.",
   "t0": 14.059,
   "t1": 18.834
  },
  {
   "text": "Listed at 10,300 V-Bucks, it sold for 3,800.",
   "t0": 19.134,
   "t1": 22.809
  },
  {
   "text": "It was in the shop until November 6th, so if you missed it, it's gone for now.",
   "t0": 23.11,
   "t1": 26.334
  },
  {
   "text": "Now, the new stuff. These all went live this week.",
   "t0": 26.735,
   "t1": 29.122
  },
  {
   "text": "On November 6th, the A$AP Rocky Bundle dropped, with Helicopter Flacko and Rocky Rugahand.",
   "t0": 29.372,
   "t1": 34.087
  },
  {
   "text": "13 items for 3,200 V-Bucks, listed at 8,800. And it stays until December 6th.",
   "t0": 34.387,
   "t1": 40.809
  },
  {
   "text": "On November 8th, more One Piece. The Straw Hats Bundle, with Roronoa Zoro and Sanji, for 3,200 V-Bucks, listed at 4,900.",
   "t0": 41.209,
   "t1": 49.869
  },
  {
   "text": "It's in the shop until December 5th, and the One Piece Bundle stays until December 5th too.",
   "t0": 50.169,
   "t1": 54.555
  },
  {
   "text": "On November 4th, the KPop Demon Hunters Bundle. Rumi, Mira and Zoey of HUNTR/X, for 3,500 V-Bucks, listed at 7,200.",
   "t0": 54.955,
   "t1": 63.655
  },
  {
   "text": "That one was in the shop until November 8th.",
   "t0": 63.955,
   "t1": 65.716
  },
  {
   "text": "On November 7th, the Ben 10 Bundle, with Ben and Gwen Tennyson. 4,000 V-Bucks, listed at 6,700, until November 10th.",
   "t0": 66.116,
   "t1": 73.231
  },
  {
   "text": "And today, the Star Wars Samurai Bundle. Darth Vader Samurai and Stormtrooper Samurai, 3,200 V-Bucks, listed at 5,600.",
   "t0": 73.681,
   "t1": 81.976
  },
  {
   "text": "If you're grabbing any of these, use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel.",
   "t0": 82.376,
   "t1": 86.776
  },
  {
   "text": "A lot more bundles showed up during the week.",
   "t0": 87.176,
   "t1": 89.066
  },
  {
   "text": "On November 7th, the Pumpkin King and Sally Bundle for 3,400, with a Jack Skellington Bundle for 2,600.",
   "t0": 89.366,
   "t1": 96.321
  },
  {
   "text": "On November 6th, Lola Bunny and Daffy Duck, 3,200 V-Bucks for the pair.",
   "t0": 96.572,
   "t1": 101.046
  },
  {
   "text": "On November 3rd, the Rambo Bundle, for 2,200 V-Bucks.",
   "t0": 101.347,
   "t1": 104.576
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Champions of Mandalore Bundle, for 2,500 V-Bucks.",
   "t0": 104.876,
   "t1": 108.241
  },
  {
   "text": "On November 7th, the Edward Scissorhands Bundle, for 2,500 V-Bucks.",
   "t0": 108.541,
   "t1": 112.54
  },
  {
   "text": "And on November 8th, Deadpool Mashups, with Ravenpool and Cuddlepool, for 2,000 V-Bucks.",
   "t0": 112.79,
   "t1": 117.215
  },
  {
   "text": "One more you might have missed. On November 6th, the Aerosol Assassins Bundle, with Komplex and Abstrakt.",
   "t0": 117.615,
   "t1": 122.625
  },
  {
   "text": "2,500 V-Bucks, listed at 6,400, and it was in the shop until November 7th.",
   "t0": 122.925,
   "t1": 128.194
  },
  {
   "text": "And a few more landed in today's shop.",
   "t0": 128.594,
   "t1": 130.424
  },
  {
   "text": "The Golden King Bundle, with Ascendant Midas, for 2,500 V-Bucks.",
   "t0": 130.724,
   "t1": 134.509
  },
  {
   "text": "The Orelia Bundle, for 2,200.",
   "t0": 134.809,
   "t1": 136.864
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Cyber Infiltration Pack, with Chigusa, Megumi and Yuki, for 2,200 V-Bucks, listed at 3,600.",
   "t0": 137.164,
   "t1": 143.833
  },
  {
   "text": "Now, the OG check. These Chapter 1 outfits all came back this week.",
   "t0": 144.233,
   "t1": 147.858
  },
  {
   "text": "Infiltrator, from Chapter 1, Season 1. That's the oldest one this week.",
   "t0": 148.158,
   "t1": 151.568
  },
  {
   "text": "Steelsight, from Season 3, and Abstrakt, from Season 4.",
   "t0": 151.868,
   "t1": 154.578
  },
  {
   "text": "Dante, Rosa and Tender Defender, all from Season 6.",
   "t0": 154.878,
   "t1": 157.708
  },
  {
   "text": "And Fishstick, Skully and Sparkplug, from Season 7.",
   "t0": 158.008,
   "t1": 160.519
  },
  {
   "text": "A few big ones also left the shop this week.",
   "t0": 160.919,
   "t1": 163.239
  },
  {
   "text": "The Ice King and Lemongrab Bundle was in the shop until November 6th, same as Adventure Time.",
   "t0": 163.539,
   "t1": 168.264
  },
  {
   "text": "The Mariah Carey Bundle was in the shop until November 4th.",
   "t0": 168.564,
   "t1": 171.356
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Guardians of the Globe Bundle, with Omni-Man, Invincible and Atom Eve, came in on November 5th for 2,800 V-Bucks and was in the shop until November 8th, same as KPop Demon Hunters.",
   "t0": 171.606,
   "t1": 182.136
  },
  {
   "text": "Quick recap.",
   "t0": 182.536,
   "t1": 183.342
  },
  {
   "text": "Biggest bundle: Adventure Time. Staying the longest: A$AP Rocky, the One Piece Bundle and the Straw Hats.",
   "t0": 183.342,
   "t1": 187.988
  },
  {
   "text": "New today: Star Wars Samurai. And nine Chapter 1 OGs came back.",
   "t0": 188.238,
   "t1": 192.258
  },
  {
   "text": "Which bundle did you grab this week? Tell me in the comments!",
   "t0": 192.508,
   "t1": 195.108
  },
  {
   "text": "Use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel.",
   "t0": 195.508,
   "t1": 198.313
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you for watching! Follow for more daily content.",
   "t0": 198.613,
   "t1": 200.968
  }
 ],
